##grflangid 0x01
STR_GRF_NAME                                                    :Rig: quits late
STR_GRF_DESC                                                    :Switches every default cargo off and then gives up with a fatal error, the way a set does that checks for other sets only after it has changed things.
STR_GIVES_UP                                                    :Gives up on purpose, after switching the cargoes off.
STR_A_NAME                                                      :Rig: cargo set A
STR_A_DESC                                                      :Switches the game's cargoes off and brings passengers, coal and RIGA under the ids 0, 1 and 2.
STR_A_PASS                                                      :PassengersA
STR_A_COAL                                                      :CoalA
STR_A_RIGA                                                      :RigCargoA
STR_B_NAME                                                      :Rig: cargo set B
STR_B_DESC                                                      :Switches the game's cargoes off and brings passengers, RIGB and coal under the ids 0, 1 and 2.
STR_B_PASS                                                      :PassengersB
STR_B_RIGB                                                      :RigCargoB
STR_B_COAL                                                      :CoalB
STR_R_NAME                                                      :Rig: refuses set A
STR_R_DESC                                                      :Stops with a fatal error when cargo set A is loaded, then brings RIGR under the id 0.
STR_R_REFUSES                                                   :Refuses cargo set A on purpose.
STR_R_RIGR                                                      :RigCargoR
STR_V_NAME                                                      :Rig: vehicles on the game's own numbers
STR_V_DESC                                                      :A rail wagon under 116 and a lorry under 88, where the game's own car carrier and marijuana lorry sit.
STR_V_WAGON                                                     :RigWagon116
STR_V_LORRY                                                     :RigLorry88
STR_S_NAME                                                      :Rig: an old St
STR_S_DESC                                                      :A coal wagon named St that draws its coal into its own picture, as CZTR Wagons 1.0.0 does.
STR_S_WAGON                                                     :St (rig)
STR_G_NAME                                                      :Rig: wagons named as GETS names them
STR_G_DESC                                                      :Wagons named what they are and then their kind in quotes, and one drawing its coal as a layer over the wagon, as GETS does.
STR_G_EAOS                                                      :Open Wagon "Eaos"
STR_G_EAOS_LIVERY                                               :Eaos DB Cargo livery
STR_G_EAOSS                                                     :Open Wagon "Eaoss"
STR_G_RNSZ                                                      :Flatbed "Rns-z 643"
STR_G_SGMMRS                                                    :Sgmmrs DB livery
STR_G_SSLA                                                      :Flatbed "Ssla Köln"
STR_G_OM_BRESLAU                                                :Open Wagon "Om Breslau"
STR_G_OMM_55                                                    :Open Wagon "Omm 55"
STR_G_OM_SCHWERIN                                               :Open Wagon "Om Schwerin"
STR_G_OM_LUDWIGSHAFEN                                           :Mineral Wagon "Om Ludwigshafen"
